Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)}I've built sbozh.me to get you sbozhed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For this, I had to take my mask off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,80)}And here's what I've found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,120)}LOOK HOW BIG MY {\c&H0B9EF5&}EGO{\c&HFFFFFF&} IS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,250)}I've become your {\c&H0B9EF5&}EMPEROR{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:19.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}But for your comfort, I can appear like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,120)}I've killed myself 16 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}For the 17th, I need an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:25.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And you can't run away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We are locked here together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I will go deep inside of you, to see what you are made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I will make you stay naked in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And wait for my Dick Pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And there are only us to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,120)}Didn't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}We've got plenty of time.
